  aciklama:
  - "Ayn\u0131 dalda b\xFCy\xFCmelerine ra\u011Fmen, beraber \xE7i\xE7ek a\xE7mamakta
    direten meyveler var fal\u0131nda. Beraber b\xFCy\xFCd\xFC\u011F\xFCn ya da uzun
    y\u0131llar\u0131n\u0131 birlikte ge\xE7irdi\u011Fin ve \u015Fu anda k\xFCs oldu\u011Fun
    biri var m\u0131 {{isim}}? O ki\u015Fi \xF6zel hayat\u0131ndaki \xE7alkant\u0131l\u0131
    durumlardan ve moralinin \xE7ok yerinde olmay\u0131\u015F\u0131ndan bir \u015Fekilde
    haberdar olmu\u015F. Telvelerin, {{kelime, 5 g\xFCn i\xE7inde | 6 g\xFCn i\xE7inde
    | 7 g\xFCn i\xE7inde | yakla\u015F\u0131k 8-9 g\xFCn i\xE7inde | yakla\u015F\u0131k
    10 g\xFCn i\xE7inde | yakla\u015F\u0131k iki hafta i\xE7inde | yakla\u015F\u0131k
    \xFC\xE7 hafta i\xE7inde}} o ki\u015Fi taraf\u0131ndan aranaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    ve k\u0131rg\u0131nl\u0131klar\u0131 ard\u0131nda b\u0131rakarak ondan destek
    g\xF6rece\u011Fini f\u0131s\u0131ld\u0131yor."
